# Shell scripts must stay LF — CRLF silently corrupts commands when executed on Windows
# (a trailing \r gets appended to the last argument on each line, or breaks backslash line
# continuations). Found live 2026-09-08: gen-kafka-certs.sh and vault-init.sh had CRLF and
# had genuinely never been run successfully as a result — this was masked until prod's
# deploy automation actually exercised them for the first time.
*.sh text eol=lf
